    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d671">

                <pb facs="0632" n="548" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg548"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 867.48/644</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Saloniki</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Horton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 1, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>For Doctor Ryan [from American Red Cross]:</p>
                <p>Red Cross through State Department is arranging to purchase everything
                    serviceable in <hi rendition="#italic">
                        Caesar’s</hi> cargo at Alexandria and requesting
                    British authorities to forward immediately to Saloniki, consigned to American
                    Red Cross with directions to advise you. American Red Cross.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
